  m_text: "Mythic Interactive \u2014 InkJourney\nLast updated: April 2026\n\n1. Who
    we are\n\nInkJourney is developed and operated by Mythic Interactive. If you
    have any questions about these terms or your data, contact us at mythicinteractivestudio@gmail.com.\n\n2.
    Accepting these terms\n\nBy using InkJourney you agree to these terms. If you
    do not agree, please do not use the app. We may update these terms from time
    to time \u2014 continued use of the app after an update means you accept the
    revised terms.\n\n3. Who can use InkJourney\n\nYou must be at least 13 years
    old to use InkJourney. By using the app you confirm that you are 13 or older.
    If we become aware that a user is under 13, we will delete their account and
    data.\n\n4. What InkJourney does\n\nInkJourney lets you place written notes on
    a map tied to real locations, discover notes left by others nearby, and connect
    with other users. Notes are visible to other users according to the privacy setting
    you choose when posting.\n\n5. Your content\n\nYou own the content you post.
    By posting, you grant Mythic Interactive a licence to store and display that
    content within the app. You are responsible for everything you post.\n\nThe following
    are prohibited:\n\nExplicit, sexual, or adult content\nHarassment, threats, or
    abuse directed at any person\nHate speech or content that discriminates based
    on race, gender, religion, sexuality, disability, or any other characteristic\nContent
    that is illegal under UK law\nImpersonation of any person or organisation\nSpam
    or repetitive posts\nWe reserve the right to remove any content that violates
    these rules and to suspend or delete accounts that repeatedly do so.\n\n6. Your
    data\n\nWe collect and use the following data to operate the app:\n\nLocation
    \u2014 to place your notes on the map and show you notes nearby. Location is
    only used while the app is active unless you grant background location permission.\nUsername
    and profile picture \u2014 to identify you to other users.\nDevice identifier
    \u2014 to maintain your account across sessions.\nNotes and content \u2014 stored
    on our servers and visible to other users according to your privacy settings.\nPush
    notification token \u2014 to send you notifications about nearby notes and friend
    activity.\nWe use Firebase (Google) to store data and deliver push notifications.
    Google's privacy policy applies to data processed through Firebase.\n\nWe do
    not sell your data to third parties.\n\n7. Data retention and deletion\n\nYou
    can delete your account at any time from within the app. When you do, your profile
    and notes are permanently deleted from our servers. Some residual data may remain
    in backups for up to 30 days before being purged.\n\nTo request deletion of your
    data directly, email mythicinteractivestudio@gmail.com.\n\n8. Your rights (UK
    GDPR)\n\nIf you are based in the UK, you have the right to:\n\nAccess the personal
    data we hold about you\nRequest correction of inaccurate data\nRequest deletion
    of your data\nObject to how we use your data\nTo exercise any of these rights,
    contact us at mythicinteractivestudio@gmail.com. We will respond within 30 days.\n\n9.
    Disclaimer\n\nInkJourney is provided as-is. We do not guarantee uninterrupted
    service and are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the
    app. We are not responsible for content posted by other users.\n\n10. Governing
    law\n\nThese terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales."
